# Test Scenario: School Platform

Purpose:
  Practical test of the chain graph system.

Owns: chains\test-scenario.sdd
Input:
  "Build an education platform for schools.
   Video conferencing, payments, AI search should be included.
   20K users in first 10 months, 1M in 2 years."

Expected Flow:
  D0 -> P1 -> D0
  D0 -> D1 -> D0
  D0 -> S1 -> D0
  D0 -> C1 -> D0
  D0 -> R1 -> D0
  D0 -> DEP1 -> D0

Token Budget:
  P1: <= 5000
  D1: <= 10000
  S1: <= 15000
  C1: <= 40000
  R1: <= 5000
  DEP1: <= 5000
  Total: <= 70000

Validation:
  - All arms return to D0
  - Token delta recorded
  - Human gates respected
   - No direct project/ access before S1

State: +
